>> title: Grilled Cheese
>> servings: 1
>> time: 12 minutes
>> tags: familiar, watchme, sandwich, skillet, browning

Spread @mayonnaise{1%tbsp} on the outside faces of @sandwich bread{2%slices}.

Layer @cheddar cheese{2%oz} between the bread slices.

-- watch: Pan heat is gentle enough that bread sizzles softly, not aggressively.
Place the sandwich in a #skillet{} over medium-low heat.

-- watch: Bottom bread is evenly golden while cheese starts to soften.
Cook the first side for ~{4%minutes}, pressing lightly with a #spatula{}.

-- watch: Second side is golden and cheese has melted to the edges.
Flip and cook for ~{3%minutes} more.

Rest on a #cutting board{} for ~{1%minute}, then slice diagonally.
